# Ignore everything in .claude by default — it holds machine-local state
# (settings.local.json, launch.json, worktrees/, session caches).
*

# ...except the skills and agents, which should travel with the repo so they
# work on other machines. (course-principles/SKILL.md and agents/course-improver.md
# are symlinks into the tracked course/agent/ tree; course-build-blog is a real file.)
!.gitignore
!skills/
!skills/**
!agents/
!agents/**
